    <string name="app_name">FgoGotran</string>
    <string name="accessibility_summary">Recognizes FGO story text and shows a translation overlay after the user starts the service.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_description">FgoGotran is not an accessibility aid. It uses an accessibility service to detect the FGO window and taps, capture the FGO screen for OCR after the user starts the service, and forward taps on the translation overlay back to FGO.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_title">Accessibility service purpose</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_message">FgoGotran is not an accessibility aid. After you start the service, it is used only for FGO translation:\n\n• Detect FGO window changes and taps to decide when to refresh story translation\n• Capture the current FGO screen for OCR after you start the service\n• Show the translation overlay above FGO\n• Forward taps on the translation overlay back to FGO\n\nIf you use an online translation API, the text to be translated is sent to the translation service you selected or configured. FgoGotran does not read contacts, messages, passwords, or banking app content, and it does not control other apps when the service is not running.\n\nIf Android shows this service as on but FgoGotran still shows it as disconnected, turn the service off in system settings, then turn it on again.\n\nContinuing means you understand and agree to these uses.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_not_connected_title">Accessibility service not connected</string>
    <string name="accessibility_not_connected_message">Even if system settings show it as enabled, FgoGotran may not have received a service connection.\n\nTranslation cannot start right now. Check the FgoGotran accessibility service in system settings:\n\n• If the switch is on: turn it off, wait 2–3 seconds, then turn it on again.\n• If the switch is off: turn it on.\n• Return to FgoGotran, confirm the status shows Connected, then start the overlay service.\n\nIf it still cannot connect, fully restart the emulator and try again.</string>
    <string name="overlay_permission_title">Overlay permission purpose</string>
    <string name="overlay_permission_message">FgoGotran needs the \"Display over other apps\" permission to show translation buttons, menus, and results over FGO.\n\nThis permission is used only for the FGO translation overlay. You can turn it off in system settings at any time; after that, the translation button and overlay cannot be displayed.\n\nContinuing means you understand and agree to these uses.</string>    <string name="api_title">API</string>
